.TH "GF-PLAYLISTS-CREATE-PLAYLIST" "1" "May 2026" "" ""

.SH NAME
gf-playlists-create-playlist - Creates playlist


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgf playlists create-playlist [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Creates playlist

.PP
Please refer to new API
\[la]?api=playlist.grafana.app\-v1\[ra]\&.

.PP
Body schema (CreatePlaylistCommand):
  interval            string
  items               array
  items[].Id          number
  items[].PlaylistId  number
  items[].order       number
  items[].title       string
  items[].type        string
  items[].value       string
  name                string

.PP
Response schema (CreatePlaylistOK.Payload):
  id        number
  interval  string
  name      string
  uid       string


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--body\fP=""
	Request body JSON or path to a JSON file (e.g. --body=/path/to/body.json, --body='{"foo": "bar"}'). The 'Body schema' block above lists fields and types; use --describe-body-jsonschema for a strict JSON Schema.

